{{disambig msg|the card|the trinket of the same name|Ace of Spades}}

{{cit|uc|a+}}

== Effects ==
* Turns all [[pickup]]s, [[trinkets]] and [[chest]]s in the room into {{e|Key}}s.
* {{dlc|r}} All non-boss enemies in the room are also transformed into keys.

== Notes ==
* ''For tips on how to unlock the '''Ace of Spades''', see [[Achievement_Tips#Obscure_Challenge_Achievements| Achievement Tips]].''
* Any unlocked key variant can appear.
* {{dlc|r}} On-kill effects such as {{i|Charm of the Vampire}} do not trigger from turning enemies into keys.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Friendly]] enemies will be transformed into keys.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.
* {{i|Blood Puppy|nr+}}: Using an Ace card on an angry Blood Puppy will create the respective pickup and tame it.

